    {
      "path": "references/rules/alarm-diagnostics.md",
      "reason": "错误码、诊断上下文和复位边界规则。"
    },
    {
      "path": "references/rules/type-system.md",
      "reason": "IEC 类型系统、显式转换和跨类型赋值风险。"
    },
    {
      "path": "references/iec-prohibitions.md",
